# SASS / UI

- No Angular Material, PrimeNG, Bootstrap, or Tailwind component kits
- Layout and color are Tailwind v4 utilities. Tokens live in `src/tailwind.css` and are aliased with `@theme inline` — do not copy hex into utilities
- Dark mode is `data-theme` on `<html>` (the `dark:` variant). Do not use `prefers-color-scheme`
- Breakpoints are the desktop-first `max-w480` … `max-w1024` variants. Use logical utilities (`ps`/`pe`, `ms`/`me`, `start`/`end`)
- Shared primitives under `src/app/shared/ui/` only
- Prefer native `<button>`, `<input>`, `<a>` with attribute-selector components when wrapping
- Keep components small; auth layout vs shell layout are separate
- Keyframes and `::before` / `::after` rules that a utility cannot express stay in `src/tailwind.css` until the last template that needs them is gone
- Loading visuals (skeletons, global bar, overlay, spinner) share one shimmer, defined once and used by the shared loading components — never restyle them per page
- Skeletons reuse the real layout utilities of the section they stand in for
